      "params": {
        "text": "Continental Congress (spec/systems/founding_fathers.md func_03C282 cost + func_03BFD2 selection). Trigger: bell pool (+0x0C) >= ff_cost(diff,year,count): base (diff+3)*16 human / (14-diff)*8 AI, +50% per era gate 1600/1650/1700/1750, *(count+1)+1, first father half. Selection = era-weighted RANDOM over un-acquired fathers; the 3 @FATHERS columns are era-band weights (<1600 / 1600-99 / >=1700). Modeled here over one representative father per category (Smith/Magellan/Washington/Jefferson/Penn) with their REAL @FATHERS weights; the full game weights all 25 un-owned fathers (weight values are runtime-BSS)."
